WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.576
Same event, different rail.

2
00:00:03.559 --> 00:00:05.846
A brand belongs to one country,

3
00:00:05.846 --> 00:00:07.280
so start by switching

4
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.034
to your Nigerian brand.

5
00:00:09.927 --> 00:00:11.776
Then create a ticketed event,

6
00:00:11.776 --> 00:00:12.978
just as before.

7
00:00:14.847 --> 00:00:16.747
The basics don't change.

8
00:00:16.827 --> 00:00:17.709
Name it,

9
00:00:17.709 --> 00:00:20.455
set the format and the party type.

10
00:00:21.143 --> 00:00:22.668
Choose the vibe tags

11
00:00:22.668 --> 00:00:24.730
and every genre you'll play

12
00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:27.368
afrobeats, afro house,

13
00:00:27.419 --> 00:00:28.607
amapiano.

14
00:00:29.084 --> 00:00:30.868
They all show up as tags

15
00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:32.231
on your event page.

16
00:00:32.909 --> 00:00:35.199
Then a line or two about the night.

17
00:00:36.647 --> 00:00:37.784
Pick the date,

18
00:00:37.826 --> 00:00:39.248
when doors open

19
00:00:39.248 --> 00:00:40.735
and when it ends.

20
00:00:41.445 --> 00:00:43.282
Then check the timezone.

21
00:00:43.331 --> 00:00:45.015
This night is in Lagos,

22
00:00:45.015 --> 00:00:46.654
so set it to Lagos.

23
00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:52.947
Name the venue,

24
00:00:52.972 --> 00:00:55.519
search for the address, and pick it.

25
00:00:56.261 --> 00:00:58.261
Hide address keeps it

26
00:00:58.261 --> 00:00:59.840
for ticket holders only.

27
00:01:03.747 --> 00:01:05.944
For the cover, choose a video.

28
00:01:06.226 --> 00:01:07.948
Processing can take a while,

29
00:01:07.948 --> 00:01:09.777
and you don't have to watch it.

30
00:01:09.908 --> 00:01:11.204
Close the sheet

31
00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:12.601
and keep working.

32
00:01:13.349 --> 00:01:15.361
Set the theme in the meantime:

33
00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:16.399
a green,

34
00:01:16.517 --> 00:01:18.695
Poppins, and confetti.

35
00:01:19.117 --> 00:01:20.968
The preview shows each

36
00:01:20.968 --> 00:01:22.408
choice as you pick it.

37
00:01:23.174 --> 00:01:25.408
Come back and the cover is ready.

38
00:01:25.731 --> 00:01:28.050
Add your photos, up to eight

39
00:01:28.181 --> 00:01:31.187
guests swipe through them after the video.

40
00:01:31.396 --> 00:01:33.113
Then use this cover.

41
00:01:42.913 --> 00:01:45.402
Tickets work exactly as before

42
00:01:45.402 --> 00:01:47.294
but the price is in naira.

43
00:01:47.445 --> 00:01:49.277
That's the one real difference

44
00:01:49.277 --> 00:01:50.600
from the Stripe video:

45
00:01:50.745 --> 00:01:53.267
this brand is set up in Nigeria,

46
00:01:53.267 --> 00:01:55.465
so it runs on Paystack.

47
00:01:56.179 --> 00:01:57.557
Add a waitlist,

48
00:01:57.557 --> 00:01:59.143
allow transfers,

49
00:01:59.155 --> 00:02:00.208
and save.

50
00:02:04.547 --> 00:02:07.221
Keep it public, with transfers on.

51
00:02:09.347 --> 00:02:11.451
Step seven checks demand

52
00:02:11.451 --> 00:02:13.145
and competition first.

53
00:02:13.192 --> 00:02:15.774
The forecast gives you a likely range,

54
00:02:15.774 --> 00:02:17.262
not a promise.

55
00:02:17.548 --> 00:02:20.734
Publish, and sales open straight away.

56
00:02:21.347 --> 00:02:22.922
And it's live,

57
00:02:22.922 --> 00:02:24.033
in green,

58
00:02:24.061 --> 00:02:27.071
with the cover and your photos up top.

59
00:02:27.897 --> 00:02:29.815
The same seven steps

60
00:02:29.815 --> 00:02:31.894
just a different rail underneath.

61
00:02:31.945 --> 00:02:35.363
And every customer Mingla drives your way

62
00:02:35.363 --> 00:02:36.992
lands right here.
